>>
endobj
877 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 468 0 R
/E ( This lab course is primarily being offered to the III Year B.E. Mechanical Engineering Students to make them understand the principles of i.e. conduction, convection, Radiation boiling and Condensation modes of heat transfer and principles of Refrigeration and Air Conditioning. Laboratory is equipped with the set up of Pin Fin Apparatus, Heat transfer in Natural convection, Composite Wall Apparatus etc.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [13]
>>
