/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 470 0 R
/E ( The laboratory component of the Automation in Manufacturing course aims to provide hands-on experience with automation technologies used in manufacturing industries. Through practical experiments, students will explore industrial robotics, flexible manufacturing systems \(FMS\), and automation machinery. The lab exercises are designed to reinforce theoretical concepts and develop problem-solving skills for real-world automation challenges.)
